@@@ccf09b61a3d7d5f1e6e5c6d4ae16a870f1e3fd69	Improve input preprocessor failure diagnostics (#328)	This fixes gwsw/less issue #327.
* configure.ac: Check for sys/wait.h and for strsignal.
