@@@5854746277892cc790633ac2926659eccfb58561	windows: SGR processor: increase buffer size for less issues	We're aware of at least one non critical issue, so increase the buffer
to a size which is much much less likely to reach end-of-buffer in
a single output line.

We can restore the original buffer size once we replace the parser.

