-            http://www.gnu.org/software/global/global.html).  The -t option may
-            also be specified from within less (using the - command) as a way of
-            examining a new file.  The command ":t" is equivalent to specifying
-            -t from within less.
+            that command is executed to find the tag.  (See http://www.gnu.org/
