@@@02858e12796ae7e95207ed8e229ee18a107e8b24	Don't remove marks from history file when --save-marks is not specified.	Previously exiting a less session which did not use --save-marks would
write a new history file containing no saved marks, even if marks had
been saved in the previous history file.

