in 774cb5e3c590d270f48ca9c7f7933da8ed8e5c70 and
501af7b41db6cecbdfde4bd5d5c3599271af0e51, and has the potential to
continue to cause issues. Allowing any command to interrupt means that
simply typing ahead can inadvertently interrupt an operation.
